Refinement received & CP-factor-domain refinement (its own formulation)\\
Adaptation & Fiber-sampling tensor completion of the reference dropped,
this tensor being fully observed; panel labels taken from the association
of the CP factors; mapping extended to oriented panels and a common
clock\\
