refinement-matched diagnostic of Section~\ref{sec:aspub}, not this row)\\
Stopping rule & Evidence change $<10^{-6}$\\
Refinement received & None beyond its own closed-form WLS fusion of the
converged per-panel posterior; the published construction removes the
clock by a delay difference against a direct link this scene does not
have, which is why its native-readout floor does not vanish with SNR
(Section~\ref{sec:aspub})\\
Adaptation & SISO single-RIS angle grid replaced by a per-panel near-field
