floored at $10\%$ of the clock search interval, are discarded before the
weighted-least-squares fusion, which is then recomputed on the retained
set; at least two paths are always kept\\
Iteration cap & $80$ CPD iterations per group; $2$ SAGE cycles of $\leq30$
iterations; WLS $\leq100$ function evaluations\\
Stopping rule & CPD relative tolerance $10^{-7}$ with ridge $10^{-8}$ and
relative residual stop $10^{-4}$; SAGE relative change $10^{-4}$\\
Read-out & Fisher-weighted least-squares fusion of per-path parameters into
