Reference & $20260729$ & $0.0355$ & $0.0357$ & $1.929$ & $1.926$ & $0.09$ & $0.57$\\
Typical & $20260727$ & $0.0249$ & $0.0247$ & $5.375$ & $5.384$ & $0.06$ & $1.62$\\
Typical & $20260728$ & $0.0064$ & $0.0064$ & $0.192$ & $0.193$ & $0.02$ & $0.06$\\
