\label{tab:s_resfail}
\centering
\scriptsize
\setlength{\tabcolsep}{3.5pt}
\begin{tabular}{lccccc}
\toprule
Mode & $n$ & Neither & Delay only & Pairing only & Both\\
\midrule
Scalar & $11\,520$ & $1\,720$ & $6\,583$ & $2$ & $3\,215$\\
Dual-pol. & $11\,520$ & $3\,771$ & $4\,877$ & $25$ & $2\,847$\\
Full EVS & $11\,520$ & $6\,512$ & $2\,668$ & $51$ & $2\,289$\\
